      "text": [
        " خَبَرٍ آخَرَ عَنْ عَبْدِ اَللَّهِ بْنِ سِنَانٍ قَالَ: قُلْتُ لَهُ مَمْلُوكٌ فِي يَدِهِ مَالٌ أَ عَلَيْهِ زَكَاةٌ قَالَ «لاَ» قَالَ قُلْتُ فَعَلَى سَيِّدِهِ فَقَالَ «لاَ لِأَنَّهُ لَمْ يَصِلْ إِلَى اَلسَّيِّدِ وَ لَيْسَ هُوَ لِلْمَمْلُوكِ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.1635 - In another report from Abdullah ibn Sinan, he said:\nI asked him (Imam Jafar ibn Muhammad Al-Sadiq (as)) \"A slave has wealth in his possession. Is Zakat obligatory on it?\"\nThe Imam (as) replied: \"No.\"\nI then asked: \"Is it obligatory on his master?\"\nImam (as) replied: \"No, because it has not reached the master, and it does not belong to the slave.\""
        ]
      }
    },
